{"text": "A man had three sons. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the youngest was called Simpleton. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everyone laughed at him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And thought he was foolish. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The oldest son went into the forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To cut wood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His mother gave him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A sweet cake. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And a bottle of wine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the forest he met a little gray old man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I am hungry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Please give me some cake and wine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the old man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I give you some. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will have none for myself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Go away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the oldest son rudely. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he began. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To cut down a tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His axe slipped. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It cut his arm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he had to go home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That was the little gray mans doing.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "t", "h", "r", "e", "e", " ", "s", "o", "n", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "y", "o", "u", "n", "g", "e", "s", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "S", "i", "m", "p", "l", "e", "t", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "E", "v", "e", "r", "y", "o", "n", "e", " ", "l", "a", "u", "g", "h", "e", "d", " ", "a", "t", " ", "h", "i", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s